WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.934
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers,
this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.934 --> 00:00:03.934
We hope you're doing well.
And now, if you don't mind,

00:00:03.934 --> 00:00:05.167
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:08.634
Last night was Super Bowl LVII,
and out of habit,

00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:10.467
Biden shot down
the Goodyear blimp.

00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:13.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:17.767
The so-called "He gets us"
campaign ran two commercials

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:18.968
during the Super Bowl last night

00:00:18.968 --> 00:00:20.734
to promote Jesus
and Christianity.

00:00:20.734 --> 00:00:22.667
However, thanks to the referees,

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:25.000
Philadelphia no longer believes
in God.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.901 --> 00:00:30.501
During her halftime show
performance at last night's

00:00:30.501 --> 00:00:32.667
Super Bowl, Rihanna revealed
she was pregnant,

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:35.300
while the rest of us
just ate like we were.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.467 --> 00:00:40.767
According to new analysis,
more than 50 million Americans

00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:43.534
were expected to gamble
this year on the Super Bowl.

00:00:43.534 --> 00:00:46.734
By serving Buffalo wings
in a one-bathroom apartment.

00:00:46.734 --> 00:00:49.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.734 --> 00:00:54.534
-Elon Musk was photographed
last night at the Super Bowl

00:00:54.534 --> 00:00:56.567
sitting next to Fox chairman
Rupert Murdoch.

00:00:56.567 --> 00:00:58.100
I think we have a photo.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.934 --> 00:01:05.000
There you go.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.133
The State Department today
issued a do not travel advisory

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:09.133
for Russia.

00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:12.100
Yeah, we weren't planning on it.

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:15.033
"Bad news, kids. I know you had
your hearts set on

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:20.901
going to the Kremlin, but looks
like we're going to do Disney."

00:01:20.901 --> 00:01:22.767
The State Department said last
week that the downed

00:01:22.767 --> 00:01:26.033
Chinese spy balloon was carrying
surveillance equipment capable

00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:28.100
of intercepting communications.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.834
They needed someone on spying

00:01:29.834 --> 00:01:33.133
on people who still haven't
downloaded TikTok.

00:01:33.133 --> 00:01:34.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.901 --> 00:01:37.167
The FBI announced on Friday
that it found

00:01:37.167 --> 00:01:39.033
an additional
classified document

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:41.667
at former Vice President
Mike Pence's Indiana home.

00:01:41.667 --> 00:01:45.334
Even weirder, they found it in
a file marked "work stuff."

00:01:45.334 --> 00:01:47.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.133 --> 00:01:50.934
"Oh, it actually is work stuff."

00:01:50.934 --> 00:01:54.968
An owl was recently removed from
a college library in Georgia.

00:01:54.968 --> 00:01:56.033
And this is annoying --

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:58.000
now it's saying "whom."

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.901 --> 00:02:07.801
My two favorite things,
Shoemaker, owls and grammar.

00:02:07.801 --> 00:02:09.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.601 --> 00:02:12.267
Authorities in Texas
recently responded to a report

00:02:12.267 --> 00:02:15.400
of two goats on the loose
in a Target store.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.434
The goats were captured and
safely returned

00:02:17.434 --> 00:02:19.234
to T.J. Maxx.

00:02:19.234 --> 00:02:21.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.367 --> 00:02:24.067
And finally, a woman in Chile
set a Guinness World Record

00:02:24.067 --> 00:02:26.934
after swimming about 1.5 miles
in Antarctic water.

00:02:26.934 --> 00:02:30.000
Said the woman, "Can someone
please rescue me?!"

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.300
And once again,
we've miscalculated

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:39.067
what our closer was.

00:02:39.067 --> 00:02:40.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.434 --> 00:02:41.901
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:02:41.901 --> 00:02:44.467
We're done. Owl --
should have closed with owl.

